  "contentHtml": "<div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"6crjn-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"6crjn-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"6crjn-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">교육용 앱 변환하기 11탄(오늘은 1개지만 적극 추천)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"bjac7-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"bjac7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"bjac7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">천체 운동 가상실험 - 내행성,외행성,별의 일주운동, 태양의 연주운동, 달의위상변화, 별의 연주운동등을 실험</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"8ehk0-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"8ehk0-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"8ehk0-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"2i16m-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"2i16m-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"2i16m-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\"> - 단순해 보이지만 이 프로그램 하나로 천체와 관련된 모든 현상을 설명할 수 있는 엄청난 앱이다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"f8d7-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"f8d7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"f8d7-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"dbarh-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"dbarh-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"dbarh-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">- 원래 천체운동 관련 수업을 해보면 지구도 돌고, 달도 돌고, 태양도 돌고, 우주도 돌다가 결국 학생들 머리도 돌아 버린다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"2bk45-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"2bk45-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"2bk45-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">주변 다른 교과 선생님들도 달이 언제 뜨는지 살짝 질문해 보면 학교 다닐때 배우긴 배웠는데 원리를 설명하려다가 거의 대부분 막 돌아 버린다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"clhlq-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"clhlq-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"clhlq-0-0\"></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"clhlq-0-0\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999573415C4FADEB09\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"783\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"사용자 지정 3.png\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"783\"  id=\"A_999573415C4FADEB091024\"/></p><p><br></p><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"271er-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"271er-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"271er-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">- 그래서 만들었다. 보기에는 별거 아닌 것 같지만 이 가상실험으로 한단원 공부하는 내내 반복해서 수업을 할 수 있다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"ab5sq-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"ab5sq-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"ab5sq-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">내가 수업시간에 활용하는수업설명팁도 어제 시간을 내어 자세하게 정리해 놓았다. 내가 개발한 가장 아끼는 프로그램 중 하나이다. 아래 링크에 가서 수업설명팁을 보면서 직접 프로그램을 실행시켜서 따라해 보면 왜 내가 아끼는지 알 수 있을 것이다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"13ld5-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"13ld5-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"13ld5-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"2liat-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"2liat-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"2liat-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">- 매시간 앞에서 시범으로 보여 주었는데 이제는 앱으로 만들어 학생들이 모둠별 태블릿을 이용해 직접 조작해 볼 수 있고, 서로 문제도 만들어 볼 수 있다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"3gn1k-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"3gn1k-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"3gn1k-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"18bmg-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">자세한 설명은 아래 링크 참고 - 윈도우용 프로그램도 있다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"e58mc-0-0\" data-editor=\"bdnfi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"e58mc-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"e58mc-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">https://sciencelove.com/1106</span></span></div></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
